<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila Bulletin sets 25 centavo cash div.</title>
<headline>Manila Bulletin sets 25 centavo cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manila Bulletin Publishing Corp declared a 25 centavo cash dividend to shareholders as of February 14, the Philippine Stock Exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>The ex-dividend date is set on February 5.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
